message: "If you use these audits or their data, please cite them as below."
title: "National research metadata audits: Austria and the Netherlands"
abstract: >-
  Country by country, the metadata completeness and FAIR scores of the repositories registered at
  DataCite by the country's members, and the completeness of the ORCID profiles whose public
  affiliation to one of the country's education and research organisations carries its ROR id, for all affiliated profiles and for
  current staff. Covers Austria and the Netherlands. The aggregated results in data/ are under
  CC BY 4.0; the code is under MIT. Profile-level data are available for research on request.
  It runs at https://rijdho.github.io/national-research-metadata-audits/.
